{"parse": {"title": "Divine General", "pageid": 7053, "revid": 47320, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\"><b>Overview</b></span></h2>\n<p><b>Divine General</b> is a <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> unit. Hе can only be obtained by upgrading <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Sorcerer_(Ritual)\" title=\"Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)\">Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)</a> to when he gets the Ritual skill, and using the Ritual active skill. The player will have the ability to control what mode Divine General fights in, these modes being: Attack, Defend, and Boss.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stats_Overview\">Stats Overview</span></h2>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-character\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Divine General</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"deployment_cost\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Deployment Cost</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 3px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black;color: #ffc608;\">106,400¥</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"total_cost\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Total Cost</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 3px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black;color: #ffc608;\">106,400¥</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"upgrade_levels\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Upgrade Levels</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"spawn_cap\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Spawn Cap</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Tower_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Tower Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ground</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Damage_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Damage Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px;\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #38fcff; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #0f3efa, 0 0 2px #0f3efa, 0 0 2px #0f3efa;\">Magic </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3b/Damage_type_Magic.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113212417\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Magic\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3b/Damage_type_Magic.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113212417\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Magic.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Magic.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Secondary_Damage_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Secondary Damage Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px;\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #6d6da3; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #27003a, 0 0 2px #27003a, 0 0 2px #27003a;\">Dark </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/32/Damage_type_Dark.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113230911\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Dark\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/32/Damage_type_Dark.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113230911\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Dark.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Dark.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Attacks\">Attacks</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Scream\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Scream</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Car_Toss\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Car Toss</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Slash\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Slash</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Jump\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Jump</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p>\nIn <b>Defend Mode</b>, Divine General uses a Full AOE attack to scream at his current location. This attack deals about <b>0.51x</b> the value of the <b>Damage</b> stat or equally <b>1.66x</b> the value of the <b>Summon</b> stat of the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Sorcerer_(Ritual)\" title=\"Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)\">Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)</a> used to summon Divine General. This attack triggers at a rate of about <b>1x</b> the SPA of <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Sorcerer_(Ritual)\" title=\"Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)\">Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)</a>. His <b>Jump</b> attack triggers at a rate of about <b>2x</b> the SPA of <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Sorcerer_(Ritual)\" title=\"Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)\">Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)</a>. This attack targets the <b>First</b> enemy on the map.</p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p>\nIn <b>Attack Mode</b>, Divine General uses a Circle AOE attack to throw a car at enemies. This attack deals <b>1.25x</b> the amount of damage of his <b>Scream</b> attack. This attack triggers at a rate of about <b>1x</b> the SPA of <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Sorcerer_(Ritual)\" title=\"Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)\">Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)</a>. His <b>Jump</b> attack triggers at a rate of about <b>2x</b> the SPA of <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Sorcerer_(Ritual)\" title=\"Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)\">Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)</a>. This attack targets the <b>First</b> enemy on the map.</p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p>\nIn <b>Boss Mode</b>, Divine General uses a Single Target attack to teleport to an enemy and slash them. This attack deals <b>2.5x</b> the amount of damage of his <b>Scream</b> attack. This attack triggers at a rate of about <b>0.5x</b> the SPA of <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Sorcerer_(Ritual)\" title=\"Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)\">Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)</a>. His <b>Jump</b> attack triggers at a rate of about <b>1.5x</b> the SPA of <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Sorcerer_(Ritual)\" title=\"Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)\">Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)</a>. This attack targets the <b>Strongest</b> enemy on the map.</p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p>\nUsed in <b>all Modes</b>, Divine General uses a Circle AOE attack to disappear from the map and land on a targeted enemy (targeting varies based on mode). This attack deals <b>2x</b> the amount of damage of his <b>Scream</b> attack. This attack's rate seems to vary depending on the mode.</p></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Adaption\">Adaption</span></h2>\n<p>Divine General has the ability to adapt every time he kills an enemy or assists in killing an enemy. The player will be able to choose an adaptation (one of three) every 50 takedowns. Divine General becomes fully adapted once all adaptations have been unlocked (150 total takedowns).\n</p>\n<div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Divine_Wings\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Divine Wings</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Heavenly_Force\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Heavenly Force</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Adapted_Slash\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Adapted Slash</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p>\n<b>Divine Wings</b> turns Divine General <b>hybrid</b>. Allowing Divine General to target and attack <b>flying enemies</b>.</p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p>\n<b>Heavenly Force</b> adds the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Effects#Knockback\" title=\"Effects\">Knockback</a></b> effect to his <b>Scream</b> and <b>Jump</b> attacks.</p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p>\n<b>Adapted Slash</b> grants a <b>+100% Crit Rate</b> while using his <b>Slash</b> attack.</p></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Divine General is currently bugged, whenever it is summoned it will always be its shiny version.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Divine General is the first summon unit that can walk while attacking and does not die when colliding with another unit.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Although Divine General's Scream attack damage depends on the <b>Summon</b> value of the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Sorcerer_(Ritual)\" title=\"Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)\">Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)</a> used to summon Divine General, all of his other attacks' damage seemingly scales off of his Scream attack instead, if you have buffs applied to the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Sorcerer_(Ritual)\" title=\"Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)\">Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)</a> they do not carry over to Divine General, instead Divine General only takes the buffless dmg</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Divine General is able to be buffed by limit breaks, applying a 30% damage boost to all his attacks. When applied with the damage boost <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Sorcerer_(Ritual)\" title=\"Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)\">Shadow Sorcerer (Ritual)</a> gains, he can gain a x1.69 damage boost from max limit break.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Divine General can be buffed by <a href=\"/wiki/Elfy_(Sylph)\" title=\"Elfy (Sylph)\">Elfy (Sylph)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wind_Dragon\" title=\"Wind Dragon\">Wind Dragon</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Reincarnation)\" title=\"Griffin (Reincarnation)\">Griffin (Reincarnation)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_(Risen)\" title=\"Zombie (Risen)\">Zombie (Risen)</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Blossom\" title=\"Blossom\">Blossom</a> if Divine General is within their range.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Divine General wont be buffed by <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_(Risen)\" title=\"Zombie (Risen)\">Zombie (Risen)</a> if Divine General is summoned before <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_(Risen)\" title=\"Zombie (Risen)\">Zombie (Risen)</a> is placed</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022034814\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.113 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.126 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 363/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5546/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 22/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 4/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3382/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.059/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 7366878/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  115.113      1 -total\n 95.34%  109.748      1 Template:Tower_Infobox\n  1.89%    2.172      2 Template:Tower_Infobox/Damage_type\n  1.57%    1.802      1 Template:Rarity\n  1.26%    1.450      1 Template:Unit_Navigation\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_animeadventures853:pcache:idhash:7053-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261022034814 and revision id 47320. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "images": ["Damage_type_Magic.png", "Damage_type_Dark.png"], "sections": [{"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "<b>Overview</b>", "number": "1", "index": "1", "fromtitle": "Divine_General", "byteoffset": 0, "anchor": "Overview", "linkAnchor": "Overview"}, {"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Stats Overview", "number": "2", "index": "2", "fromtitle": "Divine_General", "byteoffset": 326, "anchor": "Stats_Overview", "linkAnchor": "Stats_Overview"}, {"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Attacks", "number": "3", "index": "3", "fromtitle": "Divine_General", "byteoffset": 529, "anchor": "Attacks", "linkAnchor": "Attacks"}, {"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Adaption", "number": "4", "index": "4", "fromtitle": "Divine_General", "byteoffset": 2263, "anchor": "Adaption", "linkAnchor": "Adaption"}, {"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Trivia", "number": "5", "index": "5", "fromtitle": "Divine_General", "byteoffset": 2956, "anchor": "Trivia", "linkAnchor": "Trivia"}, {"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Gallery", "number": "6", "index": "6", "fromtitle": "Divine_General", "byteoffset": 4086, "anchor": "Gallery", "linkAnchor": "Gallery"}], "showtoc": false, "displaytitle": "<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Divine General</span>"}, "_provenance": {"url": "https://animeadventures.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&oldid=47320&prop=text%7Cimages%7Csections%7Cdisplaytitle&format=json&formatversion=2&disableeditsection=1", "fetched_at": "2026-10-23T13:26:42.575989+00:00", "sha256": "ed7cc042fc5db04431dc1833966ec81503eb3691d56363ba07c585aae149dc9e"}}